{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawffice is a story-driven, strategy roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coon, an average recent graduate, was granted the &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; skill during a job interview, which landed him a position as an Associate Producer at his dream game company. However, an unknown crisis awaits him in the future...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.poster.avif?t=1771042862\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.webm?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.mp4?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unleash the power of Rock-Paper-Scissors and take them down!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use turn-based &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; to defeat your opponents! Unreliable coworkers, teammates who dump their mess on others, annoying supervisors, bosses who gaslight and belittle\u2026 None of these sit right with me\u2014I\u2019m shutting them down, no questions asked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.poster.avif?t=1771042862\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.webm?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.mp4?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If I could hit restart, would the ending turn out different?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layoffs, project shutdowns, company collapse, and even \u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2014can I rewrite my fate with a second chance? Can I stop being that jittery rookie designer everyone walks all over?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.poster.avif?t=1771042862\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.webm?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.mp4?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No matter how many tries it takes, I\u2019ll find you again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This doesn\u2019t feel like a normal workplace\u2026 And they aren\u2019t just random colleagues I crossed paths with\u2014they\u2019re \u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587. Can Coon, your average college grad, break free from this \u201cworkplace\u201d that\u2019s really just a twisted game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access Version includes 1/5 of the full version\u2019s content, with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 7 story chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 10+ characters, each with multiple expressive character sprites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 30+ event illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 50+ CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is slated for release in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Early Access players get a discounted price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 A free update to the full version will be available once it launches.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4021230?t=1771042862","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/44a3cf0443b24088e1a569496286a0c27ff3468f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771042862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/886a3504ea9abc31b6c1b173edcd8b47ea35168e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771042862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/886a3504ea9abc31b6c1b173edcd8b47ea35168e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771042862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Pawffice is Now Live! </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/4b4ed0ae35ec5c8144c669243e9362f6.avif?t=1771042862\" width=1560 height=504 /></span><br><br>Hi everyone! We are Levinatee Studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pawffice</i> is a narrative-driven indie Roguelike. You play as Raccoon, a fresh civil engineering grad who accidentally gains a [Rock-Paper-Scissors] superpower during an interview at his dream game company. He joins the team to work on their new project, <i>Ace Raccoon</i>. But could this small studio be hiding a secret mission to [Save the World]...? Find out in the full release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features our unique [Rock-Paper-Scissors] combat system. Master 14 rings, 17 strategies, and 24 artifacts to take down 40+ unique enemies across 50+ random events. The story unfolds over 16 chapters, brought to life with over 100 character expressions and 40+ CGs. We hope you immerse yourself in the world of <i>Pawffice</i>! \ud83e\udd70\ud83d\ude4c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We launched Early Access last October, and thanks to your feedback, we\u2019ve managed to ship the full version just in time for the New Year! \ud83e\udd79\ud83e\udd79 A huge thank you to everyone who commented. This is our first game and we\u2019re still learning, so we genuinely appreciate your reviews and feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u263a\ufe0f We\u2019ve also prepared 20+ character side stories, which will be released as <strong>Free DLC</strong> over the next month. We\u2019ll be posting teaser videos <strong>here</strong> before the updates drop, so stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us for future updates. We\u2019d love your support! \ud83e\udd70\ud83e\udd70\ud83e\udd70</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawffice is a story-driven, strategy roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coon, an average recent graduate, was granted the &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; skill during a job interview, which landed him a position as an Associate Producer at his dream game company. However, an unknown crisis awaits him in the future...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.poster.avif?t=1771042862\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.webm?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/22486c51e35431a47af8a50891e73a00.mp4?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unleash the power of Rock-Paper-Scissors and take them down!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use turn-based &quot;Rock-Paper-Scissors&quot; to defeat your opponents! Unreliable coworkers, teammates who dump their mess on others, annoying supervisors, bosses who gaslight and belittle\u2026 None of these sit right with me\u2014I\u2019m shutting them down, no questions asked!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.poster.avif?t=1771042862\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.webm?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/a401b4829b8ff974a9d1987c2944f6b2.mp4?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>If I could hit restart, would the ending turn out different?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layoffs, project shutdowns, company collapse, and even \u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2014can I rewrite my fate with a second chance? Can I stop being that jittery rookie designer everyone walks all over?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.poster.avif?t=1771042862\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.webm?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/extras/750a16253447a7df54fb7b9844380481.mp4?t=1771042862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No matter how many tries it takes, I\u2019ll find you again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This doesn\u2019t feel like a normal workplace\u2026 And they aren\u2019t just random colleagues I crossed paths with\u2014they\u2019re \u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587\u2587. Can Coon, your average college grad, break free from this \u201cworkplace\u201d that\u2019s really just a twisted game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access Version includes 1/5 of the full version\u2019s content, with:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 7 story chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 10+ characters, each with multiple expressive character sprites</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 30+ event illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 50+ CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is slated for release in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Early Access players get a discounted price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 A free update to the full version will be available once it launches.</p>","developers":["\u98de\u5929\u6d77\u725b\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021230/5a7cc9dcf4604bf4adac9878c50756263298f6c5/header.jpg?t=1771042862","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer